  "description": "**Please Enquire Through Daft.ie**\n**Property available in Ocotber**\n\nIdeally situated within this mature and highly sought-after residential development, the property enjoys an excellent location close to a wide range of local amenities. Ongar Village and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are both within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. The area is also well served by a choice of primary and secondary schools, parks and recreational amenities.\n\nExcellent transport links include regular Dublin Bus services to the city centre, while the N3 and M50 are just minutes away, providing convenient access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and exceptionally well presented throughout. It briefly comprises an entrance hallway with generous storage, a large open-plan living and dining area, and a fully fitted contemporary kitchen complete with integrated appliances. There are two spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, including a principal bedroom with an en-suite bathroom, together with a fully tiled main bathroom.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this attractive apartment benefits from quality flooring, gas-fired central heating, a modern fitted kitchen, contemporary bathrooms and high-quality finishes throughout.\n\n\n",
